sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant App as Web App
    participant IdP as OAuth Provider
    participant API

    User->>Browser: Click "Sign in"
    Browser->>App: GET /login
    App-->>Browser: 302 redirect to provider
    Browser->>IdP: Authorization request
    IdP-->>Browser: Login + consent
    Browser->>IdP: Submit credentials
    IdP-->>Browser: 302 with auth code
    Browser->>App: GET /callback?code=...
    App->>IdP: Exchange code for tokens
    IdP-->>App: Access token + ID token
    App->>API: Call API with access token
    API-->>App: Protected data
    App-->>Browser: Session established
